---
manual: edit_line.change
lines: [3086, 3090]
testability: interactive
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $seen = []
  @line = edit_line
  @line.change { $seen << @line.text }
end
----------- test code
assert_empty $seen

edit_line.trigger_change("o")
edit_line.trigger_change("ok")
edit_line.trigger_change("o")

assert_equal %w[o ok o], $seen, "the change block runs when a character is added and when one is removed"
